{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VXZueJytRF1795874300.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本宮城縣一處山區發現兩具屍體，其中一人懷疑是失蹤近一個月的高中女生。</p><p></p><p>警方表示周五在宮城縣七宿町山林發現兩具屍體，其中一具已經部分白骨化，另一具懷疑是來自橫濱市的女生。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.CRIME-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vvPhPiYU6P1795874409.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方在調查失蹤案期間，早前拘捕一名33歲男子，根據監控片段，懷疑他拐帶女生，並且駕車載她到山區，警方於是展開搜索。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:19:46.367802+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T12:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:35:41.947812+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:59.452162+00:00","content_hash":"8fc1f66bdf589100ba488abad0f253255cc9773b2602de749dd10175f8b7b7f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}